   "notes": "Tripod cookfire (sheet 074, Fire and Light Station): 8.69 x 8.95 x 6.44. Nine faceted stones (2.2 x 2.0 x 1.2) in a packed ring; three 0.46-square grooved poles as a twisted tripod (feet in the ring's three wide gaps, tops splayed clear of the bind) with a three-turn rope bind on the crossing and three diagonal wraps; a two-link iron chain from the crotch to the bail of a 2.0-wide iron cauldron (bottom 1.81); three split logs in the centre. The flames are a campfire VFX socket, not geometry; heat_glow socket over the logs."
